p wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"> Wisdom +6</a></b>: This item makes the wearer more in tune with her surroundings, granting a +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Wisdom.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\"> Intelligence +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\"> Intelligence +6</a></b>: This item focuses the power of the wearer's mind, granting a +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Intelligence.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_Item_(Black_Abbot)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable Item (Black Abbot)\">Upgradeable Item (Black Abbot)</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_Item_(Black_Abbot)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable Item (Black Abbot)\">Upgradeable Item (Black Abbot)</a>: This item could be upgraded if you found a <a href=\"/page/Item:Seal_of_the_Black_Abbot\" title=\"Item:Seal of the Black Abbot\">Seal of the Black Abbot</a> to combine it with. Bring this item to the <a href